# Training-state flywheel: reviewed scripts + small data stay tracked so the
# pipeline is reproducible from git; weights (*.onnx, *_tfidf*.json, sig_*.json,
# .bak*.json) and vendored corpora stay out and rebuild locally via retrain_all.py
!models/training_state/
models/training_state/*
!models/training_state/*.py
!models/training_state/immortal/
!models/training_state/immortal/*.py
!models/training_state/*.md
!models/training_state/manifest.json
!models/training_state/negation_*.json
!models/training_state/*_labels.jsonl
!models/training_state/phishing_*.jsonl
